  "task": {
    "objective": "Deliver at least two cargo units from each settlement's finite supply to the public depot while managing signals, passing loops and three lendable wagons.",
    "natural_termination": "Success when public delivered counts are at least two for every cargo origin. Failure when public delivered plus banked plus loaded remaining cargo is below two for any origin, unless success. Otherwise truncate at 160.",
